  "description": "1.6.4.0 plus n°52 and n°53, a test image for the coordinator (no version digit of its own: the screens still show 1.6.4.0). n°52 (optional): the compressor envelope Amount goes down to -127 on the knob and loads below -64 from a beat file or SysEx, instead of being forced to at least -64. n°53: a note can last up to 768 units of 4 ticks (a whole 8-bar beat) instead of 255: w1 bit 15 of an event means x4 (durations above 255 are stored as a multiple of 4), recorded up to 764 units, edited up to min(beat length / 4, 768) with a step of 4 from 256; beats made before play exactly as before, the original OS plays such a note for its low byte only. Voice, Panel and SAM unchanged.",
